644
00:48:07,440 --> 00:48:24,300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These projects amount to approximately 5.02 billion covering 34,711.74 hectares and benefiting 40,775 farmer beneficiaries.

645
00:48:25,060 --> 00:48:37,300
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: Importantly, the majority of these irrigation facilities are solar-powered, providing a more sustainable and cost-efficient source of water for agriculture.

646
00:48:37,440 --> 00:48:46,060
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: We have also continued to improve physical connectivity through farm-to-market roads.

647
00:48:46,940 --> 00:48:56,240
DAR Secretary Conrado M. Estrella III: These roads help address one of the persistent challenges faced by farmers bringing their produce from farm to market.

648
00:48:56,240 --> 00:49:06,460
